  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      572.96,
      297.79,
      678.53
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land described as following names and extents depicted in the Advance Tracing No. CO/RTM/2019/149 and dated on 21.11.2019, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Mount Lavinia in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 541 - Mount Lavinia in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ratmalana in Colombo District, Western Province and bounded as follows:",
